privacy:{g:"Legal",legal:1,eyebrow:"Legal",h1:"Privacy Policy",lede:"How AltMarket collects, uses and protects your personal data.",s:[{t:"prose",b:"<p class='draft'>Draft for legal review. Replace bracketed items before launch.</p><h3>1. Who we are</h3><p>This policy is issued by AltMarket (\"AltMarket\", \"we\"), [registered address]. It applies to this website and the services offered through it.</p><h3>2. What we collect</h3><p><b>Information you give us:</b> name, email, mobile number, city, investment interest and preferred call time when you request a callback or contact us. <b>Information collected automatically:</b> basic device and usage information needed to operate the site. We do not ask for bank, card, PAN or password details through this site.</p><h3>3. Why we use it</h3><p>To respond to your request; to provide information about products you asked about; to meet legal and regulatory obligations; and, with your consent, to send updates you can unsubscribe from at any time.</p><h3>4. Legal basis</h3><p>We process personal data on the basis of your consent and, where applicable, legitimate uses permitted under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023.</p><h3>5. Sharing</h3><p>We do not sell personal data. We share it only with service providers who process it on our behalf under contract, with product manufacturers when you ask to invest in their product, or where required by law or a regulator.</p><h3>6. Retention</h3><p>We keep enquiry data for [24] months after our last interaction, or longer where the law requires.</p><h3>7. Your rights</h3><p>You may request access to, correction of, or erasure of your personal data, withdraw consent, and nominate another person to exercise your rights. Write to Aarti Nagpal at aarti.nagpal@altview.com (see Grievance Redressal).</p><h3>8. Security</h3><p>We use reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect personal data. No method of transmission is entirely secure.</p><h3>9. Changes</h3><p>We will post updates here with a revised date. Last updated: 25 September 2026.</p>"}],rel:["terms","grievance"]},
terms:{g:"Legal",legal:1,eyebrow:"Legal",h1:"Terms of Use",lede:"The rules for using this website.",s:[{t:"prose",b:"<p class='draft'>Draft for legal review.</p><h3>1. Acceptance</h3><p>By using this website you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p><h3>2. Information only</h3><p>Content on AltMarket is for general information and education. It is not an offer, solicitation or recommendation to buy or sell any security or product, and it is not investment, tax or legal advice tailored to you.</p><h3>3. Third-party data</h3><p>Fund data is compiled from public sources believed to be reliable, including disclosures that cite APMI and fund managers. We do not guarantee its accuracy, completeness or timeliness. Verify all information with the product's official documents before investing.</p><h3>4. Eligibility</h3><p>Products shown may be available only to investors meeting regulatory minimums and eligibility criteria, and may not be available in all jurisdictions.</p><h3>5. Acceptable use</h3><p>You may not copy the site's data in bulk, interfere with its operation, or use it for unlawful purposes.</p><h3>6. Intellectual property</h3><p>The AltMarket name, design and original content belong to AltMarket. Fund names and trademarks belong to their respective owners.</p><h3>7. Liability</h3><p>To the extent permitted by law, AltMarket is not liable for losses arising from reliance on information on this site.</p><h3>8. Governing law</h3><p>These terms are governed by the laws of India; courts at [city] have exclusive jurisdiction.</p>"}],rel:["privacy","disclaimer"]},
disclaimer:{g:"Legal",legal:1,eyebrow:"Legal",h1:"Disclaimer",lede:"Please read before relying on anything on this site.",s:[{t:"prose",b:"<p class='draft'>Draft for legal review.</p><p>Investments in PMS, AIFs, SIFs, GIFT City funds and mutual funds are subject to market risks, including loss of principal. Read all scheme-related documents — disclosure document, private placement memorandum or offer document — carefully before investing.</p><p>Past performance does not indicate future results. Returns shown are as reported by third parties; PMS returns are time-weighted (TWRR) at the strategy level and an individual investor's returns may differ because of timing of investment, cash flows, fees, taxes and account-specific restrictions.</p><p>Portfolio holdings, sector allocations and fees shown may be based on a model portfolio or a past date and may have changed. Nothing on this site is a recommendation to invest in any particular product, security or sector.</p><p>AltMarket does not guarantee returns and is not responsible for the performance of any scheme. References to any asset manager are for information only and do not imply an endorsement or a distribution relationship unless expressly stated.</p><p>AltMarket is registered with the Association of Portfolio Managers in India (APMI registration AMP0005858) and holds AMFI registration ARN13934.</p>"}],rel:["terms","grievance"]},
grievance:{g:"Legal",legal:1,eyebrow:"Legal",h1:"Grievance Redressal",lede:"How to raise a concern, and what happens next.",s:[{t:"steps",h:"Our process",items:[["Write to us","Email Aarti Nagpal, our Grievance Officer, at aarti.nagpal@altview.com with your name, contact details and a description of the issue."],["Acknowledgement","We acknowledge every grievance within 2 working days with a reference number."],["Resolution","We aim to resolve grievances within 21 days and will keep you informed of progress."],["Escalation","If you are not satisfied, you may escalate to the regulator using the routes below."]]},
 {t:"prose",h:"Escalating to the regulator",b:"<p class='draft'>Draft for legal review — confirm applicability to AltMarket's registrations.</p><p><b>SEBI SCORES:</b> complaints about SEBI-regulated intermediaries can be lodged at scores.sebi.gov.in.</p><p><b>Online Dispute Resolution:</b> investors may use SEBI's Smart ODR portal (smartodr.in) after first approaching the intermediary.</p><p><b>Grievance Officer:</b> Aarti Nagpal · aarti.nagpal@altview.com · [phone] · [registered address].</p>"}],rel:["privacy","contact"]}
